1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,817
At this blood-darkened cross, Willard turns prayer into an order.

2
00:00:14,417 --> 00:00:17,940
The ritual binds Arvin to a fear he cannot yet understand.

3
00:00:43,250 --> 00:00:48,160
Years earlier, one crucified Marine gave Willard's faith its permanent shape.

4
00:00:58,625 --> 00:01:02,729
The sight turns survival itself into something cruel and unbearable.

5
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:17,870
With the Marine beyond saving, mercy becomes another kind of violence.

6
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:42,618
Back home, Willard's silence lets his mother arrange the next chapter.

7
00:01:53,417 --> 00:01:57,022
Helen enters before Willard has even settled back into civilian life.

8
00:02:07,833 --> 00:02:12,164
Emma sees two wounded young people and mistakes proximity for providence.

9
00:02:46,292 --> 00:02:49,362
Willard makes Arvin study the wreckage before explaining the lesson.

10
00:03:15,125 --> 00:03:19,047
One ordinary afternoon ends the moment Charlotte cannot answer her son.

11
00:03:45,875 --> 00:03:50,552
The diagnosis leaves medicine managing pain while Willard searches beyond it.

12
00:04:01,250 --> 00:04:04,960
When the doctors give up, Willard turns to the only power he trusts.

13
00:04:32,083 --> 00:04:35,633
Willard offers what Arvin loves most as payment for Charlotte's life.

14
00:04:47,458 --> 00:04:52,353
His promise comforts nobody because Arvin has seen what faith now demands.

15
00:05:18,875 --> 00:05:22,353
Helen reads Roy's spectacle as proof that her loneliness has ended.

16
00:05:52,125 --> 00:05:56,315
Roy stays beside Helen, expecting belief to undo what belief caused.

17
00:06:09,190 --> 00:06:12,841
A waiting camera makes this generous pickup feel carefully staged.

18
00:06:25,458 --> 00:06:29,071
Sandy keeps calling Roy's name while Carl quietly controls the route.

19
00:06:42,167 --> 00:06:45,236
Arvin protects Lenora with the exact timing his father taught him.

20
00:07:00,917 --> 00:07:04,404
The birthday gift puts Willard's old weapon back into Arvin's hands.

21
00:07:20,124 --> 00:07:23,713
A polished stranger arrives to lead the same church that raised Lenora.

22
00:07:56,958 --> 00:08:01,708
Lenora hears private attention as spiritual guidance, exactly as Preston intends.

23
00:08:15,708 --> 00:08:20,298
Carl packages control as crude humor, keeping Sandy inside the performance.

24
00:08:30,542 --> 00:08:33,575
Bodecker questions his own sister with the patience of a threat.

25
00:08:49,292 --> 00:08:53,322
Preston uses sacred language to make Lenora distrust her own memory.

26
00:09:26,792 --> 00:09:30,339
Even in mourning, the family asks the same faith for mercy.

27
00:10:11,542 --> 00:10:15,929
Arvin frames the confrontation around Lenora, refusing to let Preston redirect it.

28
00:10:27,208 --> 00:10:31,056
Only after being exposed does Preston start speaking like a peacemaker.

29
00:10:58,625 --> 00:11:03,086
Carl recognizes a lone traveler, while Sandy recognizes the broken rule.

30
00:11:14,292 --> 00:11:18,402
Sandy's warning confirms that Arvin falls outside their usual hunting pattern.

31
00:11:30,042 --> 00:11:33,714
Arvin answers plainly because their practiced friendliness gives him no warning.

32
00:12:12,208 --> 00:12:15,542
A double-homicide call sends Bodecker toward the county road.

33
00:12:27,375 --> 00:12:31,230
Two measured wounds tell Bodecker this was no random roadside panic.

34
00:12:43,125 --> 00:12:46,616
The blank in Sandy's gun turns Carl's arrangement into a betrayal.

35
00:12:58,792 --> 00:13:02,613
Arvin returns to Mitchell Flats because every road began on this hill.

36
00:13:14,458 --> 00:13:17,330
The burned house leaves Arvin with memory instead of shelter.

37
00:13:30,208 --> 00:13:34,649
He keeps walking because the prayer ground matters more than the house.

38
00:13:45,875 --> 00:13:50,029
For once, Arvin remembers Willard's desperation before judging his violence.

39
00:14:01,542 --> 00:14:05,571
Understanding the motive does not erase what that devotion cost Arvin.

40
00:14:17,292 --> 00:14:21,121
At the ruined altar, anger finally makes room for understanding.

41
00:14:32,958 --> 00:14:36,404
Bodecker's voice turns Arvin's childhood woods into a hunting ground.

42
00:14:48,625 --> 00:14:52,095
The sheriff controls the clearing with noise while Arvin stays hidden.

43
00:15:04,375 --> 00:15:07,391
His claim of peaceful intent only sharpens the threat in his hand.

44
00:15:46,042 --> 00:15:50,427
Every adult calls his choice necessary, while the children inherit its cost.

45
00:16:01,750 --> 00:16:05,133
Arvin's story begins with adults choosing a future on his behalf.

46
00:16:17,542 --> 00:16:21,373
What remains compelling is how Arvin resists becoming his father's copy.

47
00:16:33,333 --> 00:16:37,808
That weight lands because Tom Holland plays Arvin without easy innocence.

48
00:16:49,042 --> 00:16:53,548
Robert Pattinson makes Preston's charm feel practiced long before it turns cruel.

49
00:17:04,833 --> 00:17:09,315
Sebastian Stan and Eliza Scanlen complete a cast built on damaged certainty.
